## OUTBOUND VERIFICATION

Before marking buyer-facing package ready:

- [ ] **Opportunity type classified** (RELATIONSHIP / COMPETITIVE / DIRECT / ALTERNATIVE / SUB-SLICE): PASS/FAIL
- [ ] **Opening matches type** (complement vs bid vs direct prime): PASS/FAIL
- [ ] **One clear wedge or win theme** (max 2 for relationship): PASS/FAIL
- [ ] **CTA matches type** (on-file vs submit bid vs quote): PASS/FAIL
- [ ] No trash-talk; proof defensible: PASS/FAIL

If any FAIL → revise before release.

